@startuml
title Airflow Spark Docker Integration - System Architecture

' Host
node "Host Machine" as host

' Shared mounted directories
folder "DAGs" as dag_dir
folder "Spark Applications" as app_dir
folder "Notebooks" as nb_dir
folder "Input Data" as data_dir

' Docker Compose network and services
rectangle "Docker Compose Network (format 3.7)" as net {
  database "Postgres 9.6\nPort: 5432" as postgres

  node "Airflow Webserver (LocalExecutor)\nImage: docker-airflow-spark:latest\nUI: 8282\nIncludes: pyspark" as airflow

  node "Spark Master (hostname: spark)\nImage: bitnami/spark:latest\nWeb UI: 8080 (host 8181)\nCluster: 7077" as spark_master

  package "Spark Workers (scalable)" as workers {
    node "spark-worker-1\nImage: bitnami/spark:latest" as w1
    node "spark-worker-2\nImage: bitnami/spark:latest" as w2
    node "spark-worker-3\nImage: bitnami/spark:latest" as w3
    node "spark-worker-N\n(scale out pattern)" as wn
  }

  node "Jupyter PySpark Notebook\nImage: jupyter/pyspark-notebook\nUI: 8888\nSpark App UIs: 4040-4080" as jupyter
}

' Core communications inside Compose network
airflow --> postgres : Airflow metadata (DB)
airflow --> spark_master : SparkSubmitOperator via "spark_default"\nspark://spark:7077
spark_master --> w1 : Worker registration & dispatch
spark_master --> w2
spark_master --> w3
spark_master --> wn : Additional workers

jupyter ..> spark_master : PySpark job submission (optional)

' Host-to-service UI and cluster access (port mappings)
host ..> airflow : 8282 (Airflow Web UI)
host ..> postgres : 5432 (Postgres)
host ..> spark_master : 8181 -> 8080 (Spark Master Web UI)
host ..> spark_master : 7077 (Spark Cluster)
host ..> jupyter : 8888 (Jupyter)
host ..> jupyter : 4040-4080 (Spark App UIs)

' Shared volume mounts
dag_dir ..> airflow : Mount DAGs
app_dir ..> airflow : Mount Spark apps
app_dir ..> spark_master : Mount Spark apps
app_dir ..> w1
app_dir ..> w2
app_dir ..> w3
app_dir ..> wn

data_dir ..> airflow : Mount input data
data_dir ..> jupyter : Mount input data
data_dir ..> spark_master : Mount input data
data_dir ..> w1
data_dir ..> w2
data_dir ..> w3
data_dir ..> wn

nb_dir ..> jupyter : Mount notebooks

' Notes and constraints
note right of airflow
- Airflow includes pyspark
- Uses pinned deps:
  celery 4.1.1, kombu 4.2.0,
  tornado 5.1.1, werkzeug 0.16.0,
  SQLAlchemy 1.3.15
- Loads DAGs from mounted directory
end note

note right of spark_master
- Spark Standalone 2.4.5 (Hadoop 2.6)
- Endpoint: spark://spark:7077
- Inherited capabilities:
  ./bin/pyspark, ./bin/run-example
  MASTER env supports local, local[N],
  spark://..., mesos://..., yarn
- Local dev/test: RPC auth/encryption & SSL disabled
end note

note bottom of workers
Workers connect to spark://spark:7077
and can be scaled by adding more
spark-worker-* services.
end note
@enduml
